const contentHtml = `<p class="lead">Your website gets traffic. It is not getting leads. That gap — between visitors and booked jobs — is what this article closes.</p>
<p>Most contractor websites convert between 2% and 5% of visitors. Top-performing plumbing sites hit 15.61%. The difference is not luck. It is a system of specific tactics that remove friction, build trust, and make it effortless for a homeowner in crisis to pick up the phone.</p>
<p>This article covers 25 tactics organized by effort and impact. Start with the Quick Wins. Layer in the Medium Effort tactics. Use the Advanced strategies once your foundation is solid. Every tactic includes a conversion lift estimate, implementation timeline, and a real contractor example.</p>
