<ul>
<li>Phone calls convert 10-15x better than web forms. Optimize for click-to-call first.</li>
<li>Mobile traffic dominates contractor websites. Every tactic must work on a smartphone.</li>
<li>Emergency services convert 60-80% higher than planned services — but only if your site signals urgency.</li>
<li>Form length is the silent killer of leads. Three fields is the maximum for first contact.</li>
